        <body>
            <div type="edition" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="div1LIT7324QeneIfatara">
                <note>This edition is based on <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/EMIP00764">Ḉäläqot, Č̣alaqot Śǝllāse, C4-IV-170</ref>, fol. 2r. The end of the poem is indicated with ። .</note>
                <ab>
                    ሣህልከ፡
                    <l n="1">ኢፈጠረ፡ ስመ፡ በላዕለ፡ ስሙ፡</l> 
                    <l n="2">ወል<choice><sic>ዳ</sic><corr>ደ</corr></choice>፡ ሥላሴ፡ መስፍን፡ ዘኢይትሜካህ፡ በአቅ<supplied reason="lost" resp="CH">ሙ</supplied>፡</l>
                    <l n="3">እስመ፡ ብሂለ፡ ዝ<persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9978Waldase">ወልደ፡ ሥላሴ፡</persName> ታሕተ፡ ስም፡ አኮ፡ ላዕለ፡ ስም፡ ዳዕሙ።</l>
                </ab>
            </div>
            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
                <note>Translation by Denis Nosnitsin.</note>
                <ab>
                    <l n="1">He did not create a name above his name,</l> 
                    <l n="2"><persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9978Waldase">Walda Śǝllāse</persName>, prince, who is not boasting with his measure,</l>
                    <l n="3">Because saying this, <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9978Waldase">Walda Śǝllāse</persName>, is under the name, but not 
                        above the name.</l>                    
                </ab>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text></TEI>